        <mxCell id="card-legend-notes" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-ligatures:none&quot;&gt;Large dashed frame: infra perimeter · small: functional group&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#fb923c&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;⚠ Gx&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;: docs and code disagree, see &quot;Gaps&quot;&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono,Noto Sans Mono,DejaVu Sans Mono,monospace;fontSize=10.5;fontColor=#94a3b8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="60" y="2130" width="540" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="card-steps" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-ligatures:none&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#34d399&quot;&gt;●&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f8fafc&quot; style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Request path · posting a tweet&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.6&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#f8fafc;color:#020617;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 4px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;1&lt;/span&gt; The browser opens frontend-epitweet.3istor.com; &lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#f8fafc;color:#020617;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 4px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;2&lt;/span&gt; the project tunnel relays to epitweet-gateway; &lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#f8fafc;color:#020617;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 4px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;3&lt;/span&gt; the gateway routes to the frontend, the only public app.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#f8fafc;color:#020617;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 4px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;4&lt;/span&gt; nginx proxies /api/posts to post-service:8082, an ExternalName alias of epitweet-post-service.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#f8fafc;color:#020617;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 4px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;5&lt;/span&gt; For a reply or a repost only, post-service asks social-graph whether either author blocked the other; &lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#f8fafc;color:#020617;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 4px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;6&lt;/span&gt; it stores the post in epitweet_posts, &lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#f8fafc;color:#020617;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 4px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;7&lt;/span&gt; publishes post.created.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#f8fafc;color:#020617;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 4px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;8&lt;/span&gt; Redis pushes post.created on timeline-service&amp;#39;s open SUBSCRIBE connection (like and search get it too); &lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#f8fafc;color:#020617;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 4px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;9&lt;/span&gt; timeline asks social-graph for the followers, page by page, &lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#f8fafc;color:#020617;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 4px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;10&lt;/span&gt; then writes their timelines in epitweet_timelines.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border:1px solid #f8fafc;color:#f8fafc;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 3px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;A&lt;/span&gt; Tunnel opened outbound. &lt;span style=&quot;border:1px solid #f8fafc;color:#f8fafc;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 3px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;B&lt;/span&gt; The secret operator reads the generated credentials from Vault.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=16;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#0b1222;strokeColor=#1e293b;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=20;spacingTop=14;spacingRight=16;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono,Noto Sans Mono,DejaVu Sans Mono,monospace;fontSize=11;fontColor=#e2e8f0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="660" y="1740" width="700" height="440" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="card-calls" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-ligatures:none&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#818cf8&quot;&gt;●&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f8fafc&quot; style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Who calls whom&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.6&quot;&gt;• &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f8fafc&quot;&gt;REST, GET.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; post and like → social-graph is-blocked-by; timeline → social-graph followers and → user /users/{id}.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f8fafc&quot;&gt;Events (Redis pub/sub).&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; user.* → post, social-graph. post.* → like, search, timeline. like.* and social.* → timeline. social.block, unblock: no subscriber. Exact channels, no pattern subscription.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f8fafc&quot;&gt;Data.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; mongodb: one database per service (user, posts, likes, social_graph, timelines). neo4j: social graph. elasticsearch: search.&lt;br&gt;• Each arrow to another app is a dependsOn link: the caller&amp;#39;s namespace gets an alias with the original hostname.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=16;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#0b1222;strokeColor=#1e293b;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=20;spacingTop=14;spacingRight=16;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono,Noto Sans Mono,DejaVu Sans Mono,monospace;fontSize=11;fontColor=#e2e8f0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1400" y="1740" width="700" height="440" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="card-contract" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-ligatures:none&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#818cf8&quot;&gt;●&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f8fafc&quot; style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Runtime contract&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.6&quot;&gt;• &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f8fafc&quot;&gt;Images.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; ghcr.io/3-istor/imports/epitweet/&amp;lt;app&amp;gt; by digest. One Maven reactor build for the 6 Quarkus images: temurin 21 JRE, USER 185, MaxRAMPercentage.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f8fafc&quot;&gt;Env.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; The analyzer keeps compose&amp;#39;s variables and rewrites hosts and credentials: REST client URLs, QUARKUS_REDIS_HOSTS, MongoDB and Neo4j URIs.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f8fafc&quot;&gt;Secrets.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; neo4j/password and admin:admin are replaced by credentials generated in Vault (kvv2 project-epitweet/&amp;lt;app&amp;gt;), synced by a VaultSecret.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f8fafc&quot;&gt;Probes.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; TCP on each service port: no health endpoint in the code.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f8fafc&quot;&gt;Network.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; All epitweet-* namespaces belong to project epitweet: the project ingress policy lets them reach each other. One mongod, five databases: one user per app scoped to its database is still to confirm (CNP-239).&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f8fafc&quot;&gt;Storage.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; Backing apps are StatefulSets with a ceph-block PVC, deleted with the app.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=16;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#0b1222;strokeColor=#1e293b;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=20;spacingTop=14;spacingRight=16;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono,Noto Sans Mono,DejaVu Sans Mono,monospace;fontSize=11;fontColor=#e2e8f0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2140" y="1740" width="740" height="440" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="card-memory" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-ligatures:none&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#fbbf24&quot;&gt;●&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f8fafc&quot; style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Memory budget (requests)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.6&quot;&gt;• 6 × 192Mi JVM · mongodb 384Mi · neo4j 768Mi · elasticsearch 1Gi · redis 64Mi · frontend 32Mi ≈ &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f8fafc&quot;&gt;3.4 GiB&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;br&gt;• On-prem has about 4 GiB of requests left: it fits, tightly. Each app namespace keeps its 2Gi ResourceQuota.&lt;br&gt;• Off hours (01:00–07:00) the project sleeps. A public cloud fallback is prepared, not launched.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=16;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#0b1222;strokeColor=#1e293b;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=20;spacingTop=14;spacingRight=16;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono,Noto Sans Mono,DejaVu Sans Mono,monospace;fontSize=11;fontColor=#e2e8f0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2920" y="1450" width="720" height="260" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="card-unsupported" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-ligatures:none&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#fb923c&quot;&gt;●&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f8fafc&quot; style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Unsupported, flagged by the analyzer&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.6&quot;&gt;• &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f8fafc&quot;&gt;api-gateway&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; in k8s/ has no source (nginx config in a ConfigMap): not imported; the frontend&amp;#39;s nginx routes /api/*.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f8fafc&quot;&gt;Health probes.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; k8s/ declares /q/health/*, but no service depends on smallrye-health: TCP probes instead.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f8fafc&quot;&gt;k8s/ ConfigMaps&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; lack the REST client and Redis URLs: the import follows docker-compose, not k8s/.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f8fafc&quot;&gt;Pub/sub&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; keeps no message: a service asleep or restarting misses events.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=16;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#0b1222;strokeColor=#1e293b;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=20;spacingTop=14;spacingRight=16;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono,Noto Sans Mono,DejaVu Sans Mono,monospace;fontSize=11;fontColor=#e2e8f0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2920" y="1740" width="720" height="440" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
